# Deny the whole context, then re-admit exactly what the runtime image needs.
# An allowlist means a new local file — an .env, a dump, a notebook — cannot be
# baked into a published layer just because someone forgot to add a deny rule.
*

!pyproject.toml
!alembic.ini
!app/
!alembic/

# Re-denied inside the allowed directories.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env*
**/*.log
